        /* jenesboat: the game owns the canvas layout (config.user_canvas = 1).  The canvas
           spans the full width of the window and as much height as keeps it at least 16:9
           (a 19.5:9 phone held sideways fills the whole screen; a 4:3 window gets a band of
           ocean colour above and below).  The game reads the resulting CSS size every frame
